{"id":"gestank","lemma":"Gestank","pos":"noun","rank":3924,"glosses":["stench, stink, fetidness"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈʃtaŋk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/De-Gestank.ogg/De-Gestank.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Gestankes","plural":"Gestänke"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich kann diesen Gestank nicht ertragen.","en":"I can't put up with this smell.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to bear"}]},{"text":"Das ist vielleicht ein Gestank!","en":"What a stench!","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"perhaps, maybe"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Der Gestank ist nicht auszuhalten.","en":"The stench is unbearable.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to stand","l":"aushalten"}]},{"text":"Der Gestank widerte mich an.","en":"The bad smell disgusted me.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Tom beklagte sich wegen des Gestankes.","en":"Tom complained of the stench.","words":[null,{"g":"to pity, to lament","l":"beklagen"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"for, because of"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null]}]}